<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσπλέω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεύσμαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sail into, enter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ στενά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.86
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				89
			</span></i>, etc.: poet. c. acc., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1389
			</span></i>: c. acc. et dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμέναιον δόμοις εἰσέπλευσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					423
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>sail
				in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀριστερὰ ἐσπλέοντι</span>”
				<i>as one sails in,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα ναυσὶ ταῖς μεγίσταις ἱκανὸν
					εἰσπλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					115d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσπλέοντας ἐκπλέοντάς τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					183
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μεγαρεῦσι μηδὲν ἐσπλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.51
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.29
			</span></i>; of corn, <i>to be imported,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.31
			</span></i>.</div>
